%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 88201f4f4f3247558c87e55aa4fb8ac4, type: 3}
  m_Name: ClaudetteFirst
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: HiddenHarbours.World::HiddenHarbours.World.DialogueDef
  Id: dialogue.claudette_first
  FirstLines:
  - 'Boudreau''s. Chandlery, hardware, and whatever else comes up the road. You''ll
    be the one off the island.'
  - 'I''ll tell you before somebody else does: I''m dearer than LeBlanc''s. I''m also
    open, I''ve got it on the shelf, and I''m not shut because the boat never came.'
  - 'Marguerite sells to forty people who knew her mother. I sell to whoever walks in
    off that road. That is the whole of the difference, and neither one of us is wrong
    about it.'
  RepeatLines:
  - 'Back over, are you. Have a look — the shelf changes every time the truck does.'
  Options:
  - Id: option.browse_wares
    Label: 'What have you got in?'
    ReplyLines: []
    CatalogSellerId: seller.nmc_chandlery
    CatalogSection: gear
    SellAtSellerId:
    NothingToSellLines: []
  - Id: option.ask_about_prices
    Label: 'Why are you dearer than the island?'
    ReplyLines:
    - 'Freight. Every last thing you can see came up the road on somebody''s truck,
      and the truck wants paying whether you buy or you don''t.'
    - 'And I carry it. Marguerite orders what she knows will go, and she''s right to.
      I keep a shelf of things nobody has asked for in a year — because the day somebody
      does, they need it that day, and there is nowhere else.'
    - 'That is what the extra is. Not greed. Standing still with your money tied up in
      a shelf.'
    CatalogSellerId:
    CatalogSection:
    SellAtSellerId:
    NothingToSellLines: []
